<title>UK: London FM radio licence to be awarded on Jan 16.</title>
<headline>London FM radio licence to be awarded on Jan 16.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Radio Authority is expected to make a decision on the award of a new London FM licence on January 16, the body said on Friday. An announcement on the award is likely after 1700 GMT on the same day.</p>
<p>The 104.9 FM frequency is up for grabs, giving access to a potential audience of almost six million adults. Twenty-five applications have been received for the licence.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
